#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:206
#: 11caffe65bbc46e38ff50dddc8974b18
msgid "ADC Pin6  -> RSSI_IN_ADC1(3.3V)"
msgstr "ADC 引脚 6 -> RSSI_IN_ADC1（3.3V）"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:209
#: 3da6a6c00dbc46f49aebdadf31f087df
msgid "Battery Monitor"
msgstr "电池监测"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:210
#: a5cbb061bd11440282a3aeee2ab20b40
msgid ""
"The board has two dedicated power monitor ports on 6 pin connectors, one for"
" an analog monitor and one for a DroneCAN monitor. The correct battery "
"setting parameters are dependent on the type of power brick which is "
"connected. By default, use of a DroneCAN battery monitor is enabled by "
"default as the first battery monitor."
msgstr ""
"该飞控板在 6 针接头上有两个专用电源监测接口，一个用于模拟监测，另一个用于 DroneCAN "
"监测。正确的电池参数设置取决于所连接的电源模块类型。默认情况下，DroneCAN 电池监测被启用为第一电池监测器。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:213
#: c7e3e5bdc5a04d6fa86e31c5de27ad91
msgid "RC Input"
msgstr "RC 输入"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:214
#: fb78d366150b48ebaee72acc12d24823
msgid ""
"The RCIN pin, which by default is mapped to a timer input, can be used for "
"all ArduPilot supported unidirectional receiver protocols. Bi-directional "
"protocols such as CRSF/ELRS and SRXL2 require a full UART connection. FPort,"
" when connected to RCIN, will only provide RC without telemetry."
msgstr ""
"RCIN 引脚默认映射至定时器输入，可用于所有 ArduPilot 支持的单向接收机协议。双向协议如 CRSF/ELRS 和 SRXL2 需要完整的 "
"UART 连接。FPort 连接至 RCIN 时仅提供 RC 控制，不提供数传。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:216
#: b512c55753294c129d768f108d7a187b
msgid ""
"To allow CRSF and embedded telemetry available in Fport, CRSF, and SRXL2 "
"receivers, a full UART, such as SERIAL6 (UART7) would need to be used for "
"receiver connections. Below are setups using Serial6."
msgstr ""
"若要使用 FPort、CRSF 和 SRXL2 接收机的内嵌数传功能，需使用完整的 UART（如 "
"SERIAL6（UART7））作为接收机连接。以下为使用 Serial6 的设置："

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:218
#: 0cabfcc8c86b4ad9b4e4b4654495c10d
msgid ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` should be set to \"23\"."
msgstr ":ref:`SERIAL6_PROTOCOL<SERIAL6_PROTOCOL>` 应设置为 「23」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:219
#: 5fa64577bc124d25a8445ecabb62243b
msgid ""
"FPort would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to "
"\"15\"."
msgstr "FPort 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「15」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:220
#: 09be786a688940bfb3957f0521e16ca5
msgid ""
"CRSF would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"0\"."
msgstr "CRSF 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「0」。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:221
#: 2fbee4010e884ac796fb2436a66fca87
msgid ""
"SRXL2 would require :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` be set to \"4\" "
"and connects only the TX pin."
msgstr "SRXL2 需要将 :ref:`SERIAL6_OPTIONS<SERIAL6_OPTIONS>` 设置为 「4」，并仅连接 TX 引脚。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:223
#: e4c80c8bc3c648f883c20cad42ac2c56
msgid ""
"Any UART can also be used for RC system connections in ArduPilot, and is "
"compatible with all protocols except PPM. See :ref:`common-rc-systems` for "
"details. The power rail associated with this connector position is powered "
"either via USB or PMU."
msgstr ""
"ArduPilot 中任何 UART 也可用于 RC 系统连接，与除 PPM 外的所有协议兼容。详情请参阅 :ref:`common-rc-"
"systems`。与该接头位置关联的电源轨通过 USB 或 PMU 供电。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:226
#: e69c68bd4435475ab3b18a512986f9cb
msgid "Loading Firmware"
msgstr "加载固件"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:227
#: 5863f0bad7654b0ba42abf5bd9a7a5c0
msgid ""
"This board comes with ArduPilot firmware pre-installed and other "
"vehicle/revision ArduPilot firmware can be loaded using most Ground Control "
"Stations."
msgstr "该飞控板预装了 ArduPilot 固件，其他飞行器类型/版本的 ArduPilot 固件可使用大多数地面控制站加载。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:229
#: bdde24e41b03409c99bad922a8a1af5d
msgid ""
"Firmware for these boards can be found here `https://firmware.ardupilot.org "
"<https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_ in sub-folders labeled “NarinFC-H7”."
msgstr ""
"该飞控板的固件可在 `https://firmware.ardupilot.org <https://firmware.ardupilot.org>`_"
" 的「NarinFC-H7」子文件夹中找到。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-NarinFC-H7.rst:231
#: 112bbf175d74424dada56f2e146ab56e
msgid ""
"The board comes pre-installed with an ArduPilot bootloader, allowing the "
"loading of \\*.apj firmware files with any ArduPilot compatible ground "
"station, such as Mission Planner."
msgstr ""
"该飞控板预装了 ArduPilot 引导程序，可使用任何 ArduPilot 兼容地面站（如 Mission Planner）加载 \\*.apj "
"固件文件。"
